      "custom": {
        "description": "Equipment-panel core envelope, 420 x 320 x 32 mm.",
        "tags": "bundled-example, topology-optimization, pymoto, geometry",
        "notes": "The core between the two facesheets. Honeycomb prisms run along Z, which here is the panel thickness - the direction a sandwich core's cells actually run.",
